From: AlphaYields <engineering@alphayields.io>
Subject: [PATCH] Point BaseStrategy at the Hedera TokenizedStrategy deployment

Yearn has no canonical TokenizedStrategy deployment on Hedera, so the singleton
was deployed from unmodified upstream source (apiVersion 3.1.0) at

    0xccC8Ee9a1A559Fa814a886A2303F03239678eC8e   (Hedera 0.0.10757286)

BaseStrategy hardcodes that address as a constant, so it must be repointed. This
is the ONLY modification to upstream Yearn code and it changes no logic.

Apply with:
    git apply -p1 --directory=lib/tokenized-strategy patches/0001-hedera-tokenizedstrategy-address.patch

--- a/src/BaseStrategy.sol
+++ b/src/BaseStrategy.sol
@@ -110,7 +110,7 @@
     // NOTE: This is a holder address based on expected deterministic location for testing
     address public constant tokenizedStrategyAddress =
-        0x2e234DAe75C793f67A35089C9d99245E1C58470b;
+        0xccC8Ee9a1A559Fa814a886A2303F03239678eC8e;
 
     /*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
                             IMMUTABLES
